{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_03",
  "title": "高塔煙火",
  "storyCode": "TW-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "906434632670d3a96a799944667517af1f8027ecc4683a56856a428ccf7596d3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 3下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡能看見議事廳塔樓！謝天謝地，那裡好像平安無事——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麗薩，動作快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？哪裡著火了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的兒子們還沒回來，有誰看到他們了嗎——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "憲兵呢，塞弗林呢！？他不是英雄嗎，這種時候怎麼不在！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街道已經一團亂了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但居民區根本沒有遭到攻擊，應當有人引導他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人的神經都已經繃緊太久了，出現爆炸，理所當然會引起騷動——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這邊！我們得保證議事廳不被攻陷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看見了！人數很多！快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個老東西，身手還不錯，不用忍受礦石病折磨的感覺挺好的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......如果我早點戒煙的話，你們這個時候已經在監獄裡學唱兒歌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開這裡，念在你們也曾是城鎮一員的份上，我不會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，還敢嘴硬！沃倫姆德現在只有你一個正規軍人，你以為我們不知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林！你的裝腔作勢結束了，讓出議事廳，從現在開始，由我們來掌握這座城鎮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你們打算做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別那麼警惕，休戰，讓我抽根煙緩緩......告訴我，你們打算做什麼？怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定沃倫姆德可以考慮你們的訴求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，我把武器放下了，我並不覺得我們有什麼不可調和的矛盾，你們為什麼要這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈。現在輪到你們講大道理了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要你們交出兇手，我要你們拋棄成見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我要回家，我要工作，簡單嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只要你填好報告，注意定期體檢，很簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在呢！？我們只是被關起來等死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那條街道只剩下地震留下的裂縫，都是隨時會爆炸的源石叢，非感染者撤離了街道，物資一天比一天貧乏，有人幫我們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，差點忘了，因為你們的無能，整座沃倫姆德都在駛向死亡，我們只是率先被拋棄的那一批人而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了所謂的秩序而隱瞞真相，你還自以為很高明嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火柴好像受潮了，既然點不著，就繼續吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！？赤手空拳——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，哪怕只聞到點煙草味，我也能有點力氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，抱歉，可能要“發生點意外”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死、放手！你要——你要殺了我嗎——呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，只是“失手”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......已經結束了，對方只有幾個人而已，除了這個倒楣蛋，其他人都逃走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你殺了他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果羅德島的二位可以讓他醒過來，那就再好不過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有氣息！亞葉姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現在救人要緊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一會我們有話要說，“長官”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，我洗耳恭聽，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過，獨處的時候，我不是你的長官，我是托爾的父親，是你的伯父。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，長官，您剛才......您剛才打算殺了那個感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那樣會激化矛盾的......！而且您不該那麼簡單就對沃倫姆德曾經的家人動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算他把沃倫姆德沒有憲兵隊的事情告訴了那些暴徒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道這意味著什麼，塔佳娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但至少不該這麼絕情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非你能知道所有事情，否則我們每一個人都很難做出正確的選擇，身不由己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果客觀上，有個偉大的銀行家或是預言家告訴我，只要死幾個人就能讓沃倫姆德重回平靜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會去做的，無論是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就算是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論，是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......至少從結果上來說，他還是撿回了一條命的，這就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說回羅德島吧，你把真相告訴他們了？還是已經帶她們去過現場了？我感覺那個孩子的眼神變了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯父，你早就猜到我會這麼做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧，我不覺得隱瞞有什麼意義，但至少我親自隱瞞一下，可以讓很多人安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得她們怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得，她們會幫助沃倫姆德的，她們都是和安托醫生一樣高尚的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，咳，那她們能代表羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然被派遣到這裡，應該可以代表羅德島的態度吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......說實話，如果我們遇見的每一個羅德島幹員都是好人，我反而會感到擔憂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，我記得那個狙擊手，她也是羅德島的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陪著安托醫生抵達這裡，然後立刻就離開的那個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願她沒有被天災捲進來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？還有別的襲擊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沃倫姆德沒有憲兵駐紮，是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個秘密好像已經人盡皆知了，下一步呢，匪徒來犯的時候，我們該跪下求饒，還是要反抗到底？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不對，這個轟鳴聲，是地下——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——塞弗林！他們從其他大街的地下通道潛進了工業區！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們把主動力爐癱瘓了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看啊，一座漂亮的，空無一人的城鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃倫姆德，冬靈山脈的月亮，嗯，名不虛傳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "月亮，一顆月亮，呸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們有四位夥伴，死在了那場烈火之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在他們都敢這麼明目張膽地陷害感染者了，下一步是什麼時候？下一步他們會做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，事到如今我們還要忍氣吞聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很激動，放輕鬆，你平時不會這麼說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們該毀掉這裡！該死的沃倫姆德人！該死的移民者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泥岩！你和你的薩卡茲們有這種力量！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對......薩卡茲，可有什麼種族比薩卡茲還深知家園被奪走的痛苦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算在這個主張讓感染者物盡其用的萊塔尼亞，薩卡茲也沒有容身之所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，但是那個老奶奶送給我們的小蛋糕，很好吃，甜得恰到好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......再等等。我們要毀掉的，只是一個兇手，不要讓仇恨溢出自己的手心，不然的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們和過去有什麼區別？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
